    "text": "Complex  <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math>  have two G.I. which are optically inactive due to presence of plane of symmetry.<br/><br/>Complex  <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>  also have two optically inactive geometrical isomers due to presence of plane of symmetry.<br/><br/>Complex  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math>  is optically active due to formation of non-superimposable mirror image<br/><br/> <img src=\"assets\\st0107_e91d2bee758b.jpeg\"/> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math>  <br/><br/>Complex  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math>  is optically inactive."
